{"id":"e34b841adb03202a","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-i-delta-zero-subtraction.md","title":"IΔ₀证明截断减法全性与唯一性","display":"thm-i-delta-zero-subtraction — IΔ₀证明截断减法全性与唯一性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-i-delta-zero-subtraction","aliases":["72-thm-i-delta-zero-subtraction"],"display":"thm-i-delta-zero-subtraction — IΔ₀证明截断减法全性与唯一性","depends_on":["[[72-df-truncated-subtraction-graph]]","[[72-df-bounded-unique-arithmetic-graph]]","[[72-df-i-delta-0]]"],"chapter":"II","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.II §§1.2.6,1.2.8(a), print85–86,89/PDF97–98,101","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-i-delta-zero-subtraction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-i-delta-zero-subtraction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-i-delta-zero-subtraction — IΔ₀证明截断减法全性与唯一性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3996ce2fa4b5ae59\" href=\"?note=3996ce2fa4b5ae59\" title=\"72-df-truncated-subtraction-graph\">72-df-truncated-subtraction-graph</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"34a6558383e94659\" href=\"?note=34a6558383e94659\" title=\"72-df-bounded-unique-arithmetic-graph\">72-df-bounded-unique-arithmetic-graph</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0e5e75be5dd53241\" href=\"?note=0e5e75be5dd53241\" title=\"72-df-i-delta-0\">72-df-i-delta-0</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"II"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.II §§1.2.6,1.2.8(a), print85–86,89/PDF97–98,101"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho:=\\operatorname{SubGraph}(x,y,z)\">\\(\\rho:=\\operatorname{SubGraph}(x,y,z)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\">\\(w\\)</span> 为不同于 x,y,z 的新鲜变量；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x=\\langle x,y\\rangle\">\\(\\vec x=\\langle x,y\\rangle\\)</span>，输出变量为 z。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BUG}_{I\\Delta_0}(\\rho,\\langle x,y\\rangle,z,x).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BUG}_{I\\Delta_0}(\\rho,\\langle x,y\\rangle,z,x).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>在 IΔ₀ 中用序的全比较。若 x≤y 取0；否则定义扩展的 ≤ 给某个 z 使 y+z=x，且非负加法给 z≤x。取消律给非零分支唯一，x≤y 时反对称与加法非负性迫使 z=0；边界 x=y 的两种表示相容。这些序、取消律由 §1.2.6 的有界归纳证明，原书(a)给出同一推导。来源陈述及这条局部推导已核对，未运行对象演算逐行证明检查。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-truncated-subtraction-graph","status":"resolved","id":"3996ce2fa4b5ae59","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-truncated-subtraction-graph]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-bounded-unique-arithmetic-graph","status":"resolved","id":"34a6558383e94659","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-bounded-unique-arithmetic-graph]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-i-delta-0","status":"resolved","id":"0e5e75be5dd53241","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-i-delta-0]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\rho:=\\operatorname{SubGraph}(x,y,z)","display":false},{"tex":"w","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x=\\langle x,y\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BUG}_{I\\Delta_0}(\\rho,\\langle x,y\\rangle,z,x).","display":true}],"bytes":1512,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-49","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"II章新增9项：[[72-df-bounded-unique-arithmetic-graph]] · [[72-df-division-remainder-graphs]] · [[72-df-truncated-subtraction-graph]] · [[72-df-unique-function-definition-extension]] · [[72-lem-bounded-function-occurrence-elimination]] · [[72-thm-i-delta-zero-division]] · [[72-thm-i-delta-zero-minimization]] · [[72-thm-i-delta-zero-subtraction]] · [[72-thm-unique-function-definition-conservative]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-45","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"II章新增9项：[[72-df-bounded-unique-arithmetic-graph]] · [[72-df-division-remainder-graphs]] · [[72-df-truncated-subtraction-graph]] · [[72-df-unique-function-definition-extension]] · [[72-lem-bounded-function-occurrence-elimination]] · [[72-thm-i-delta-zero-division]] · [[72-thm-i-delta-zero-minimization]] · [[72-thm-i-delta-zero-subtraction]] · [[72-thm-unique-function-definition-conservative]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-45","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"II章新增9项：[[72-df-bounded-unique-arithmetic-graph]] · [[72-df-division-remainder-graphs]] · [[72-df-truncated-subtraction-graph]] · [[72-df-unique-function-definition-extension]] · [[72-lem-bounded-function-occurrence-elimination]] · [[72-thm-i-delta-zero-division]] · [[72-thm-i-delta-zero-minimization]] · [[72-thm-i-delta-zero-subtraction]] · [[72-thm-unique-function-definition-conservative]]"}],"outgoing":["3996ce2fa4b5ae59","34a6558383e94659","0e5e75be5dd53241"]}